Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, Aka says he spotted a monster\Nahead that looks like the King of Souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's depending on us, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do our best!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.76,0:00:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.04,0:00:28.00,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(112,55)\fad(734,473)\fscx97}What Can Be Done as a Vending Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The King of Souls and some monsters\Nunder his command are just ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are five corpse fiends, five undead,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.62,0:00:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eight skeleton fiends,\Nand four flame skulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are 22 bodyguards in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not impossible, but not easy either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Vice Captain were here, we could\Njust wipe them all out with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I could probably take down a\Ncouple of them before they got too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should whittle down their numbers\Nbefore we engage them head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.46,0:00:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.40,0:01:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you come up with a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the device\Nthat sprays out water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet something probably comes out\Nof the tip if you pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you were right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.70,0:01:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, stuff stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this mystery liquid\Nsafe to touch? Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels greasy and it\Nkind of reminds me of oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.84,0:01:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it'll burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.98,0:01:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's incredibly volatile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting we douse the\Nenemy in this flammable oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.28,0:01:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.90,0:01:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, all we have to do is\Nfollow the plan. Here it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.86,0:01:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.20,0:01:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll remove just the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll move in using the\Nbarrier to keep out the flames,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heat, and carbon dioxide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.86,0:02:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can block any kind of magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You managed to defend against that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That pale blue light must\Nbe a barrier. Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.72,0:02:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skeleton V!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.64,0:02:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did these reinforcements come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't count on the others for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:02:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something suspicious\Nabout that box on your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, stones are ice! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.48,0:03:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can withstand this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll simply blow you\Nand that barrier away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, that was too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.48,0:03:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.02,0:03:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she using magic to withstand the winds?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, it's her blessing of might.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take more than some bad weather!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forward! Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems I've misunderstood\Nthe source of your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.24,0:03:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's absolutely nothing you can do\Nbefore this battle or worth an expense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honor your baleful wail!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:03:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.98,0:04:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Voxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shores of Earth, close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse, you girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.14,0:04:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was great, Shui!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not enough to stop me! Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try this on for size then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:26.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.18,0:05:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, I didn't expect you to take\Ndown the King of Souls so easily. Duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Lamas can get her power under control,\Nshe'd pretty much be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you people think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.88,0:05:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Figures an undead\Ndoesn't know when to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.28,0:05:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You deserve to suffer a thousand\Ndeaths for treading upon my greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.54,0:05:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's rich coming\Nfrom a talking skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.98,0:05:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me one reason I shouldn't smash\Nyou to bits and collect your coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You love my coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm a coin lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really bad! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come everything's gone black?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.90,0:05:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Points reduced by 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the first adventurers to\Nhave survived my dark torrent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take back this arm of\Nthe dead that clings to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.46,0:06:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just anyone deserves to\Nuse such a superior magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree, old visitor\Nfrom another world? Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name has long been\Nforgotten by your kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.46,0:06:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I suppose I've been\Nreferred to as the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:07:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this is the Stratum Lord's coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.72,0:07:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an amusing bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you attack us like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What other reason does one need to hunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you yourself\Ncome to this stratum to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.82,0:07:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kill the King of Souls\Nfor your own benefit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.44,0:07:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then please enlighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes it somehow different?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, human...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a phantom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Mishuel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An attack from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were in the middle of a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.40,0:07:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten what matters?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try to bite that thing head-on,\Nit's too dangerous! Boxxo! On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.80,0:07:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't tell me that's all you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.98,0:07:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a troublesome one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.28,0:08:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite everything, you\Nattack me from behind again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.18,0:08:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.54,0:08:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch them, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the others and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting to see the human\Nspirit of self-sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.26,0:08:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let you give me a treat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You promised you'd always be there\Nto help me out, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.28,0:09:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone at the orphanage\Nis counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.82,0:09:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cry all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.62,0:09:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they won't be waking up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.42,0:09:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Llamas is totally out\Nof control at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hurt too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.78,0:09:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can hit him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there. But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:10:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we can't figure out some way to stop\Nhim, Everybody's going to die here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.01,0:10:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I came up with a plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it doesn't work out, you could\Npotentially lose your life for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.62,0:10:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you already given up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.90,0:10:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you would provide me with\Na bit more entertainment, you bore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please block it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dreadfully prosaic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.64,0:10:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for that, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.48,0:10:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you'll come up with\Na way to beat this creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And until then, I won't ever give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.06,0:10:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's counting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to put my trust into her too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.48,0:10:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you already thought of a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there. Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears you've finished saying\Nyour final goodbyes to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear not, I am not a cruel being.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.96,0:11:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will reunite you with your\Ndearly-deported friends soon enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.36,0:11:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,using my most powerful\Ntechnique! It's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the first step, I'll use my\Nbarrier to eject Lamas at full power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for step two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll shoot the balloons out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.14,0:11:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think you were able to\Nshatter the arm of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:12:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to seeing how\Nyour group develops further.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for you\Nto come and find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yulemi, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You promised you'd help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.52,0:12:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't make good on your promise if\Nyou die and leave me all alone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.90,0:12:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yulemi, Shui, there's still\Nso much we have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.54,0:12:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui! Shui!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody in the Menagerie of\NBulls is allowed to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just sit there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't the association teach you\Nwhat to do in these situations?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.22,0:12:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.08,0:12:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a cardiac massage?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I think I've\Ngot something for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.72,0:12:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.66,0:12:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For Boxer to change forms all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that must mean he's got\Nan item up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree, but I've never\Nseen this form before.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.18,0:13:11.89,sign_18850_197_Automated_Extern,text (white background),0,0,0,,Automated External Defibrillator\N\N{\fs10\c&HC6C3C4&\3c&H2716A0&} Release the lock and open this door
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even in my old world, the average person\Nprobably wouldn't know how to use an AED.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I expect the people of\Nthis world to understand it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't have time to explain!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.35,0:13:17.81,sign_18850_197_Automated_Extern,text (red background),0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(162,60)\c&HA0A0A0&\3c&H1A1380&\fs21\fsp.3}Release the lock and open this door
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.81,0:13:18.77,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text,0,0,0,,{\frz12.93\fax-0.1\pos(310,225)\fs40\frx340\fry18}Abilities
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.77,0:13:21.48,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7\frz5.31\fax-0.15\pos(250,55)\t(1528,1529,\3c&HF5F4F2&\c&H000000&)\t(1778,1779,\3c&H000000&\c&HFFFFFF&)}Coin Conversion
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.77,0:13:21.48,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7\frz5.31\fax-0.15\pos(245,120)\t(1778,1779,\3c&HF5F4F2&\c&H000000&)\t(2029,2030,\3c&H000000&\c&HFFFFFF&)}Vending Compartment Shock Absorber
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.77,0:13:21.48,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7\frz5.31\fax-0.15\pos(245,183)\t(2029,2030,\3c&HF5F4F2&\c&H000000&)\t(2279,2280,\3c&H000000&\c&HFFFFFF&)}Transformation
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.77,0:13:21.48,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7\frz3.37\fax-0.15\pos(240,250)\t(2279,2280,\3c&HF5F4F2&\c&H000000&)}Telekinesis
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.77,0:13:21.48,sign_3811_54__Cold__Mineral_W,text (top to bottom),0,0,0,,{\fs10\an7\frz2.68\fax-0.15\pos(239,320)}Change Paint Color
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care how many points this costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's floating!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying this'll save them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.28,0:13:36.00,sign_19428_213_Use_according_to,text (inside),0,0,0,,{\pos(100,20)\fad(200,1)}Use according to voice\N and visual instructions
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Expose the patient's chest and retrieve\Nthe square bag from underneath the lid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, tear open the\Nbag and remove the pads.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.72,0:13:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to maximize the\Nchance that this'll work,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll increase my dexterity\Nwith the rest of my points!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.72,0:13:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finished, Boxxo! Is this good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First off...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.08,0:14:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please do not touch the patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.50,0:14:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now recording EKG.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.60,0:14:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scan complete. Reading measurements.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Electric shock is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.98,0:14:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move away from the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.44,0:14:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Electric shock has been performed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Begin manual cardiac massage immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.98,0:14:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.03,0:14:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I had thought of this sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yulami, why aren't you waking up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo gave us a special item\Nto help bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.78,0:14:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please open your eyes. Hulemy! Hulemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.01,0:14:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.10,0:14:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo, come on, Jusui!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:14:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.58,0:15:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did we win?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't need to be careful, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so hard, I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness they're alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems the people here are\Nsturdier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.24,0:15:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for being so\Nuseless during the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You put your trust in me, and when it\Nreally counted, I wasn't able to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.42,0:15:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I talked a big game, but in the end,\NI wasn't able to do anything either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the Netherlord, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.74,0:15:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's seriously bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.22,0:15:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to let Director Bear\Nknow as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was truly a monstrous opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we were to fight him again, I'm not\Nsure I'd be able to protect everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Several days later,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after Hulemy and Shui had fully recovered,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.64,0:15:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we made our way back to\Nthe Clearflow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as we arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the first thing we did was report\Nthe incident to Director Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.98,0:16:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're sure he was the Netherlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you've heard of him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.62,0:16:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.53,0:16:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I don't know much\Nsince I've only read his
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,name in passing while\Nperusing some old records.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I suspect he's a general\Nserving the Demon Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying there's someone\Neven stronger than him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.34,0:16:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In light of this new information,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.30,0:16:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be requesting an emergency meeting\Nwith the directors of each stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.08,0:16:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've done well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to get plenty of rest in\Ncase anything unexpected happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.44,0:16:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, missus! I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.90,0:16:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're finally back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I feel like I've\Nseen this scene before?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not hurt anywhere, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.41,0:16:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard you ran into an enemy that\Nwas stronger than a stratum lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.36,0:17:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I was so worried I\Ncouldn't even sleep a wink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.68,0:17:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Munami. I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the story about us fighting\Nthe nether lord had already
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.16,0:17:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,started spreading throughout\Nthe village like wildfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.46,0:17:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard about what happened, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.08,0:17:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing you were there,\Notherwise things could have been bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.24,0:17:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be modest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drove off a monster\Nstronger than a stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lord and saved Hulemy and\NShui while you were at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.02,0:17:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After everything you've done for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's safe to say you're an irreplaceable\Npart of this village, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really nice to\Nhear that kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tale of your heroism has\Nspread far and wide, Mr. Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hearing of it has only strengthened\Nmy desire to bring you into my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, until that day comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll just have to put up\Nwith living with Mommies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.36,0:17:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.27,0:17:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that about? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.88,0:17:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are there so many\Npeople in this village?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.52,0:17:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Mishel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes! Who is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.94,0:18:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you need something from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.72,0:18:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were wondering if you had\Nany other plans after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going after the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to be honest, he's\Nso strong, it's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please keep fighting by our sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.94,0:18:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't do it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much use I'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He defeated me handily.\NMr. Mishuel? That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear upon my blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, I won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise from this day forth, I won't\Nallow any of my comrades to be hurt again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.92,0:18:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.94,0:18:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear said he was going to summon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,expert hunters from each\Nof the other strata.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like 40 or 50 people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than that, I heard him throw\Naround numbers in the hundreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we really push, we could\Nprobably recruit over a thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.32,0:18:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way we could lose, right, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:18:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mishuel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.78,0:19:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's on your mind, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to figure out exactly what\Nwe're hoping to achieve out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.30,0:19:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always thought that as long as\NI'm working towards getting my wish,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.72,0:19:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'd be all right if I\Ndropped dead somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.60,0:19:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what gives me the right to put the lives\Nof my people at risk to achieve some goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one that might not even be possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never would have imagined hearing\Nsuch spineless words out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.69,0:19:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, that serious look\Ndoesn't match you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.54,0:19:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We knew the risks when we joined\Nup with the Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.86,0:19:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't think for even a second\Nthat you have to coddle us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.64,0:19:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.62,0:19:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.74,0:19:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can leave the rear to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:19:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We believe in you, so\Nkeep your head up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.70,0:19:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're right, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have said it better myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it already, so enough\Nwith all the sappy speeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.20,0:20:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.18,0:20:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're heading out tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.84,0:20:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aka, Shiro, gather up rations\Nand supplies for 30 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.04,0:20:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be getting a tab, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, 30 days?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you want us to pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of, Captain, I believe you\Nstill owe us our wages for this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.86,0:20:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas put me on her back and left the\Nvillage without saying where we were going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.86,0:20:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We walked along in silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.89,0:20:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where she's taking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.20,0:20:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we are, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.28,0:20:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the exact spot you\Nand I first met each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.82,0:20:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, this is where you first saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.80,0:20:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.22,0:20:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many things have happened\Nsince I got to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.88,0:21:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lots of it was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.34,0:21:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.25,0:21:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no matter what\Nhappened on our adventures,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.54,0:21:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you always helped out and you\Nmade sure everyone was safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.26,0:21:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've just been lucky up to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our last battle made that\Npainfully obvious. Boxxo,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something tells me that\Nyou're blaming yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for what happened in the\NDead's Lament stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.18,0:21:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.54,0:21:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, the only reason I was\Nunharmed was because you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.34,0:21:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.42,0:21:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't have been able to save\NHulemy and Shui and they would have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.74,0:21:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.22,0:21:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't feel down on yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.28,0:21:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.72,0:21:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.63,0:21:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's amazing how much empathy you can show\Ntowards a simple vending machine like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, and here we were thinking\Nyou might need some cheering up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.36,0:21:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Lamas already has it covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.32,0:22:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.23,0:22:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yolami, Shui, how'd you find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.08,0:22:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We followed you after we heard you left\Nthe village with Boxxo on your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.50,0:22:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, dang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.92,0:22:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, we still haven't\Nthanked him for saving us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.94,0:22:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.42,0:22:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.68,0:22:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.66,0:22:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what the heck are\Nyou two doing to Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.12,0:22:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just showing him our gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.32,0:22:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, if it weren't for\Nhim, we'd be in the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.92,0:22:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, you owe\NBoxo a lot, too, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.30,0:22:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could thank him\Nnow and then, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.88,0:22:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, thank him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.90,0:22:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's only fair if\NI give him a reward, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.90,0:22:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, Mom would always remind me\Nit's polite to give proper thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.36,0:22:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.42,0:22:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.06,0:22:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.38,0:22:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to die from\Nembarrassment, Olive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.88,0:22:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's stalling. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.24,0:23:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.22,0:23:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.72,0:23:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You finally did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.44,0:23:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You came for this! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.12,0:23:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being reborn as a vending\Nmachine to wander the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.44,0:23:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dungeon in another world\Nis a ridiculous premise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.92,0:23:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after everything I've been through\Nand meeting a bunch of new people,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'd like to keep\Nliving this kind of life.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.10,0:23:40.01,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon

